{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Description</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Cantonese culture-inspired visual novel set in Guangdong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story centers around Zhong Guolong\u2014a Chinese-French mixed-race Han Chinese football player\u2014and his hilariously absurd romantic adventures with four distinct heroines from ethnic minority backgrounds. All set against the backdrop of a vocational high school? You choose who to pursue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-Purchase Premium Game (No in-app purchases)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Romance Routes, including one slightly shorter route (similar to Japanese-style &quot;sub-heroine&quot; paths but still fully fleshed out).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200k\u00b110k Words Total Script</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shared Route: 80k words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal Routes: ~2k transitional events post-route lock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Final word count will be confirmed pre-launch on Steam)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ Full-Scale CG Artworks + 50+ SD Chibi CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Exact asset counts finalized before release)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Original BGM Tracks + curated stock music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Original songs previewable on official Bilibili channel)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Chat Interaction System &amp; Social Media Feed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cantonese Dialogue Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zero AI-generated content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Only AI-free proofreading for typos/grammar)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910860/extras/3e0e8a83e8ec079363c7230427844ae1.avif?t=1773460789\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910860/extras_big/3e0e8a83e8ec0